WEBVTT

00:05:30.993 --> 00:05:34.497
A stent is a metal scaffold
delivered through a catheter,

00:05:34.538 --> 00:05:37.416
which opens up like a flower
into the blood vessel.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.753
Millions of stents
are delivered each year,

00:05:40.795 --> 00:05:42.254
not in the OR,

00:05:42.296 --> 00:05:46.008
but in the cath lab
or catheter laboratory.

00:05:47.343 --> 00:05:50.971
It's now common in the cath lab
to navigate up into the brain

00:05:51.013 --> 00:05:52.348
through the blood vessels.

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:54.517
And there are 2,500 physicians

00:05:54.558 --> 00:05:57.019
who can now navigate their way
up into the brain.

00:05:57.436 --> 00:06:00.648
But what's really amazing about this